<title>POLAND: Zasada signs DM 30 mln loan agreement.</title>
<headline>Zasada signs DM 30 mln loan agreement.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-10-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish automotive group Sobieslaw Zasada Centrum SA has signed a deal on borrowing 30 million marks from Polish-German Mitteleuropaeische Handelsbank AG, Zasada said in a statement on Tuesday.</p>
<p>It said the loan would be paid back in six years.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
